      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Sacrocolpopexy is a surgical procedure that provides effective treatment for pelvic prolapse. The surgical technique and complications of laproscopic sacrocolpopexy are described. This review presents experience of MRI for postoperative assessment and illustrates normal and abnormal findings."},
